<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Documentation on Festival</title><link>https://obediencecorp.com/festival/docs/</link><description>Recent content in Documentation on Festival</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://obediencecorp.com/festival/docs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Install Festival</title><link>https://obediencecorp.com/festival/docs/install/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://obediencecorp.com/festival/docs/install/</guid><description>&lt;p id="detected-os"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Detecting your operating system...&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id="install-macos" class="install-platform" style="display:none"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="macos"&gt;macOS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The fastest way to install:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#282a36;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;brew install --cask Obedience-Corp/tap/festival
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or download the latest macOS release directly:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Obedience-Corp/festival/releases/latest" class="btn btn--primary"&gt;Download for macOS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="install-linux" class="install-platform" style="display:none"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="linux"&gt;Linux&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choose your distribution's package format:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
 &lt;thead&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;th&gt;Distribution&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th&gt;Command&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/thead&gt;
 &lt;tbody&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;td&gt;Debian / Ubuntu&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo dpkg -i festival_*_amd64.deb&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;td&gt;Fedora / RHEL&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo rpm -i festival-*.x86_64.rpm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;td&gt;Arch Linux&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;yay -S festival-bin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;td&gt;Alpine&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo apk add --allow-untrusted festival_*.apk&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Obedience-Corp/festival/releases/latest" class="btn btn--primary"&gt;Download Linux Packages&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="install-windows" class="install-platform" style="display:none"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="windows"&gt;Windows&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stable Windows packages are temporarily paused while Windows support is being hardened.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>